---
description:
  Verifies that when the flowchart.inheritDir config is set to false, a subgraph
  without its own explicit `direction` statement (subgraph B) does not inherit
  the parent flowchart's overridden direction (LR), while a subgraph that does
  declare its own direction (subgraph A, TB) uses that instead.
config:
  fontFamily: courier
---
%%{init: {"flowchart": { "inheritDir": false }}}%%
flowchart TB
  direction LR
  subgraph A
  direction TB
  a --> b
  end
  subgraph B
  c --> d
  end
